     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The first call <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">gcd(13, 23)</code> results in <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">23 - 13 = 10</code>, so the next call is <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">gcd(13, 10)</code>. Thereafter, other calls are <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">gcd(10, 3)</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">gcd(7, 3)</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">gcd (4,3)</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">gcd(3,2)</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">gcd(2,1)</code>, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">gcd(1,1)</code> for a total of eight calls."
